<title>UK: Kredietbank sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank Bankverein (Frankfurt).</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    20.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.30     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**UNTIL YEAR THREE, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 7.0 PCT</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   2.0</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
</text>
